\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My Saviour! how shall I proclaim,
\par How pay the mighty debt I owe?
\par Let all I have, and all I am,
\par Ceaseless to all Thy glory show.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Too much to Thee I cannot give;
\par Too much I cannot do for Thee;
\par Let all Thy love, and all Thy grief,
\par Graven on my heart for ever be.
\par                           Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

